  131 : // zIntegralSigmaSc: trapezoidal integral over z of sigmaScDefect(E,T(z),
  132 : // jc(z)) -- replaces the old width-averaged "coreWidth*sigmaScDefect(E,Tsc,
  133 : // jcScale)" scalar term with a proper per-z-resolved sum, at the SAME E
